exports[`Golden Behavior Lock (pre-sprint baseline) > locks formatWhatsAppBulletin across 8 inputs 1`] = `
[
  "🌿 *New Delhi Residents Welfare Group — Daily Smog & Clean Air Bulletin (VayuSaathi)*

📍 *Area:* New Delhi (Winter Scenario)
📊 *CPCB NAQI:* *428 (Severe)* | PM2.5: 285 µg/m³ (~13 cigs/day eq.)
🪟 *Safe Ventilation Window:* Open windows only during *1:00 PM – 3:00 PM*. Seal doors/windows by *5:00 PM*.

✅ *Today's 2 Community Pledges:*
1️⃣ *Zero Biomass / Leaf Burning:* Please remind society night guards & sweepers not to burn dry leaves or waste tonight — calm 4 km/h winds trap smoke at breathing level.
2️⃣ *Smarter Commute & Wet Mopping:* Swap solo car runs for Metro/carpool where possible, avoid engine idling at our main gate, and switch from dry sweeping to wet mopping today.

🤝 Small coordinated habits cut our colony's local smog together!",
  "🌿 *Block 1 RWA — आज का वायु स्वास्थ्य अलर्ट (VayuSaathi)*

📍 *क्षेत्र:* Patna (Gangetic Basin Scenario)
📊 *CPCB NAQI:* *356 (Very Poor)* | PM2.5: 192 µg/m³
💨 *सुरक्षित वेंटिलेशन समय:* केवल *1:00 PM – 3:00 PM* के बीच खिड़कियाँ खोलें। शाम *5:00 PM* तक बंद रखें।

✅ *आज के 2 सामुदायिक संकल्प:*
